{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:06fdf4d7ec341022","name":"Jedi Archivist","source":{"id":"source:reference-06fdf4d7ec341022","title":"Jedi Archivist","revision":19947,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:54:36Z","sha256":"56d72cc352e9c987d40a5dfb17b5e4cdf13b58c7d26256e55fd5c7a871a009c3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19947","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Archivist&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-06fdf4d7ec341022","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Jedi who prize knowledge over other things usually find that their understanding of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," expands with the study and retention of other subjects. Even more so than other Jedi, Jedi Archivists delve into many areas of study, letting ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," guide them to their areas of specialty. By receiving and archiving knowledge so others might learn, a Jedi Archivist increases their own awareness of the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The number of Jedi Archivists flourishes during times of relative peace in the galaxy. Though most Archivists remain close to the temple archives on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ossus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ossus","referenceId":"reference:8196389ed661366f"},", others travel to gain more information about the galaxy, its inhabitants, and its cultures, continually increasing their common pool of knowledge. Archivists also work with ",{"tag":"a","children":["ExplorCorps"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ExplorCorps","referenceId":"reference:8a4cc8c38e34e1e1"},", searching for lost civilizations or exploring and studying newly discovered star systems.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During the latter days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}," and into ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", Jedi Archivists become fewer in number. Older Jedi believe that the younger members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," do not have the patience to take on the role of an Archivist, choosing other roles deemed more important to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," at that time.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Jedi Archivist Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Knight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Knight","referenceId":"reference:8a1e23d924066b37"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},":"]}," 2; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","